Package: acme.sh
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         curl | wget,
         openssl
Recommends: socat
Description: Pure Unix shell script implementing the ACME client protocol
 acme.sh issues, renews and deploys certificates from Let's Encrypt, ZeroSSL
 and other ACME certificate authorities. It is a POSIX shell script with hooks
 for many DNS providers (dnsapi), deployment targets (deploy) and
 notification services (notify).
 .
 This package turns off the self-upgrade of acme.sh (ACME_PACKAGED); updates
 come through the package manager.
